OL,3,ABike from Batman film could sell for
OL,4,A#900,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcycle used in Sir Christopher
OL,7,FNolan's Oscar-winning 2008 Batman film
OL,8,FThe Dark Knight is expected to sell for
OL,9,Fup to #900,000 at auction.
OL,11,FThe vehicle is among lots being sold by
OL,12,FHertfordshire-based Propstore online
OL,13,Fand at Bafta in London from 4 -6
OL,14,FDecember.
OL,16,FThe "Batpod" was featured in a chase
OL,17,Fscene that included Christian Bale's
OL,18,FBatman and Heath Ledger's Joker and it
OL,19,Falso appeared in the 2012 sequel The
OL,20,FDark Knight Rises.
